1
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:07,830
I got my teacher evaluations. Look what this student wrote.
我剛拿到教師評鑒表 你們聽這個學生寫的

2
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:12,340
"I loved Dr. Geller's class. Mind-blowing lectures.
「我愛蓋勒博士的課」 「令人大呼過癮」

3
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:17,670
You are definitely the hottie of the Paleontology Department."
「蓋勒博士」 「您是古生物學系的猛男」

4
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:23,350
"Hotties of Paleontology." There's a big-selling calendar.
古生物學系的猛男們 做成月曆一定賣

5
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:28,580
-Who wrote it? -The evaluations are all anonymous.
那是誰寫的？ 我也想知道 但評鑒表是匿名的

7
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:30,850
-You have their exams? -Yeah.
期末考考卷還在嗎？ 在啊

8
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:35,390
You could just match the handwriting and there's your admirer.
你可以拿考卷來對筆跡 就知道仰慕者是誰了

9
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,960
A hot girl's at stake and he's Rain Man.
只要和女色有關 他就成了大天才

10
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:45,730
Wait a minute. Why are we so sure that this is a girl?
等等，為何確定是個女生？

11
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,410
It's a girl!
是女生

12
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:53,970
But it wouldn't matter.
總之沒差 

13
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:57,580
Because I'm a teacher. She's a student.
因為我是老師 她是學生

14
00:00:57,790 --> 00:01:00,150
-It's illegal? -It's frowned upon.
校規說不行？ 沒有，但是會有爭議 瞭解

16
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:03,620
-And there's a big age gap. -When you're 90..
而且年齡差那麼多 你就這麼想，等你90歲…

17
00:01:03,890 --> 00:01:08,230
I know,she'll be 80 and it won't seem like such a big difference.
我知道，我90她就80 感覺就差不多了

19
00:01:09,730 --> 00:01:12,220
That's not what I was gonna say.
我不是要說這個

20
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:18,770
When you're 90, you'll still have the memory of being with a 20-year-old.
我是說等你90歲 還能擁有跟小妹妹戀愛的回憶

22
00:01:21,110 --> 00:01:23,270
The One Where Ross Dates A Student
本集播出：「師生戀」

00:01:25,110 --> 00:01:26,270
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

23
00:01:59,110 --> 00:02:02,350
-Monica..? -I don't know.
摩妮卡… 我不知道 好吧

25
00:02:03,220 --> 00:02:07,180
You know your college friend who became a movie director?
錢德 你知道你那個 當上導演的大學同學嗎？

27
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:10,910
Oh yeah, Dana Keystone. She was in my movement class.
知道，黛娜基史東 我們一起修動作課

28
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:16,620
-What's a movement class? -He's pretending he didn't take mime.
什麼是動作課？ 錢德在假裝他沒修默劇

30
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:22,100
She's directing a new Al Pacino movie. You gotta get me an audition.
總之她要導艾爾帕西諾的新片 你得幫我爭取試鏡

31
00:02:22,300 --> 00:02:24,570
I haven't talked to her in 10 years.
我不知道，我們10年沒聯絡

33
00:02:24,770 --> 00:02:27,640
Please,Chandler, I would owe you so much.
不，求求你，就當我欠你

34
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:31,040
You do owe me so much. You owe me 3000..
你本來就欠我 你欠我3千4百… 

35
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:34,940
Hey,hey,dude. Why you changing the subject? What?
老兄 你幹嘛轉移話題？ 什麼？

37
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:38,080
-Will you make the call? -Okay,I'll try.
你打不打電話？ 好吧，我試試看

38
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:43,480
Thanks. Last auditions are Thursday, so I gotta get in by Thursday.
謝了，你最好了 試鏡是星期四截止 我星期四之前得過去 

42
00:02:43,730 --> 00:02:46,460
Remember Thursday. Remember Thursday?
記得星期四就對了，你記得嗎

43
00:02:47,630 --> 00:02:49,220
Yeah,so Tuesday?
星期二嗎？

44
00:02:50,770 --> 00:02:52,530
Thursday!
是星期四

45
00:02:52,770 --> 00:02:57,640
Just think of it like this: The third day. Monday, one day.
你如果記不住就記是第三天 星期一，一天

47
00:02:57,940 --> 00:02:59,840
Tuesday,two day.
星期二，二天

48
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:02,270
Wednesday... When day, what day?
星期三，三小  哪一天？

49
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,670
Thursday!
星期四

50
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:06,500
The third day, okay?
第三天，好嗎？

51
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:09,270
-Thank you. -Okay.
謝謝你 不客氣

52
00:03:11,050 --> 00:03:12,920
-Hey,Monica..? -She doesn't know.
摩妮卡… 她不知道

53
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:19,380
-I'm gonna check my messages. -You thought of that in there?
摩妮卡，我要聽留言 你在廁所裡想到這個？

54
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:23,430
Nature called. She wants to see who else did.
當然，生理需求結束 她想知道還有誰需要她

55
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,130
Hello?
喂？

56
00:03:28,170 --> 00:03:29,330
Rachel.
瑞秋

57
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,870
Someone's in our apartment. Call the cops!
我們家有人，快報警

58
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:33,630
You're on the phone!
你在用電話

59
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:37,200
-Oh,my God! -What?
天哪… 怎麼？

60
00:03:37,410 --> 00:03:38,880
Oh,my God! Thank you!
天哪，謝謝你

61
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:41,310
There was a fire at our place.
是消防隊，家裡失火了

62
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:45,980
-Oh,my God! How bad was it? -It was a fire,I'm guessing not good.
天哪，有多嚴重？ 他沒說，但失火總是不太妙

64
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:49,020
-Come on, we gotta go! -Yeah,come on.
快走吧 快點

65
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:53,660
What are you smiling about?
笑什麼笑？有什麼好笑的？

66
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:59,460
The part I want to audition for is a fireman. This is so meant to be!
我要應徵的角色是消防隊員 這真是天意

67
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:11,340
You were very generous with your grades this semester.
你這學期的成績給得很大方喔

68
00:04:17,250 --> 00:04:19,280
-Professor Geller? -Yeah?
蓋勒教授？

69
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:25,620
-I really enjoyed your class. -Oh,thank you. Thanks very much.
-我很喜歡你的課 -謝謝你，非常感謝

71
00:04:26,690 --> 00:04:30,260
I'm a little embarrassed about calling you a hottie.
不好意思，說你是猛男

72
00:04:30,930 --> 00:04:32,590
-That was you? -Yeah.
-那是你？ -對

73
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:37,700
I felt a little weird about it. You're a teacher. I'm a student.
我後來覺得怪怪的 你是老師，我是學生

75
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:39,940
Want to go out sometime?
但或許你願意和我約會？

76
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:43,910
That's not the best idea.
這樣恐怕不太好

77
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:48,110
Oh,because I was thinking, the semester's over.
我想說學期結束 

78
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:51,950
-You're not my teacher anymore. -What time?
-你就不是我的老師了 -什麼時候？

80
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:55,580
Oh,you know what? Forget it.
當我沒說

81
00:04:55,790 --> 00:04:58,260
I see you already gave me an A.
你已經給我A了

82
00:04:59,090 --> 00:05:01,960
-Gotcha. -I'm kidding! God!
-瞭解 -開玩笑的

83
00:05:03,970 --> 00:05:06,260
So seriously, what time?
說真的，什麼時候？

84
00:05:10,470 --> 00:05:13,770
Coming through. Coming through. Oh! Hello. Hi.
借過，借過 你好

86
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:16,270
Right. Coming through!
不對，借過

87
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,570
Okay. It's not so bad.
還好嘛 

88
00:05:18,810 --> 00:05:22,080
Most of the damage was contained to the bedrooms.
災情主要集中在臥房

89
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:26,220
Hey,buddy, think I could borrow your uniform this Thursday?
老兄 這星期四可以跟你借制服嗎？

90
00:05:26,420 --> 00:05:29,360
-Excuse me? -Joey! He's working.
-什麼？ -喬伊，人家在忙

91
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:32,020
You would look good in that.
你穿一定很帥

92
00:05:33,290 --> 00:05:34,990
Oh,how bad is it?
災情如何？ 

93
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,660
It's really bad.
很慘，非常慘

94
00:05:36,860 --> 00:05:41,860
The only thing that isn't burned is an ax, which I do not remember buying.
只有一斧頭沒被燒到 我根本不記得有買過

95
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:45,000
-How's your room? -Everything's ruined.
瑞秋你呢？ 東西都燒光了

96
00:05:45,210 --> 00:05:47,640
My bed,my clothes. Look at my favorite sweater.
床鋪，衣服 你看我最喜歡的藍毛衣 

97
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:49,570
Isn't that mine?
那不是我的嗎？

98
00:05:49,810 --> 00:05:52,370
Fine. I'm sorry for your loss.
好，我對你的損失深感遺憾

99
00:05:53,780 --> 00:05:58,310
You won't be able to live here for a while. You have a place to stay?
這裡暫時不能住人 你們有地方去嗎？

100
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,850
Oh! Wow!

101
00:06:00,050 --> 00:06:02,990
Okay,look,pal...
好，你給我聽著 

102
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:06,480
I am not in the mood to be hit on right now.
我現在沒心情被搭訕

103
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:10,990
But if you give me your number, I'll call you sometime.
不過要是你給我電話 我改天會打給你

104
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:14,360
Yes, they can stay with us.
她們可以跟我們住

105
00:06:14,570 --> 00:06:17,940
Do you know what started the fire, Mr. Fireman?
請問起火原因是什麼？

106
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,700
Well,do either of you smoke?
你們有人抽煙嗎？

107
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:24,240
No. But yeah, I could use one now. Thanks.
沒有，不過現在來一根也好

108
00:06:24,550 --> 00:06:29,180
-Do you light candles, burn incense? -I do all the time. I love them!
-不是，你們有人點蠟燭焚香嗎 -有，我常點，我很喜歡

110
00:06:30,550 --> 00:06:34,720
Oh,my God, I did it! It's me, it's me! I burned down the house!
天哪，是我害的 我把房子給燒了

111
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:39,220
Okay,Phoebe,calm down. There's no need to place blame. Okay?
菲比，別激動 沒有必要怪誰，好嗎？

112
00:06:39,530 --> 00:06:41,760
I warned her about those candles.
我警告過她

113
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:49,030
I can't believe how long it's been.
能聊聊真好，居然這麼久了

114
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,170
Hey,Chandler,is that..?
錢德，是不是…

115
00:06:53,610 --> 00:06:57,040
-Oh,that's great, good for you. -So,is it..?
太好了，恭喜你 聽著…

117
00:06:58,710 --> 00:07:03,210
Okay. So,yeah, maybe we can get together...
好，我們可以見個面…

118
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,060
Hold on for one second.
你等我一下…

119
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:11,490
What?
怎樣？

120
00:07:11,690 --> 00:07:14,960
Do you want to get a pizza later?
等你講完，要不要叫披薩？

121
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:16,830
Hi,I'm back.
我回來了

122
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:21,190
Yeah,that sounds great. We'll do it then. Okay,bye.
聽起來不錯 好，就這麼決定…好，再見

123
00:07:24,770 --> 00:07:29,210
When's my audition? I know it's Thursday, but what time?
我什麼時候試鏡？ 我知道是星期四，但是幾點？

124
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,510
Hi. We didn't get to it.
我們沒聊到那個 

125
00:07:31,710 --> 00:07:34,200
I'm taking her to coffee. We'll do it then.
我帶她去喝咖啡時再說

126
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:37,110
Now you're going on a date with this girl?
你要跟這個女生約會？

127
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,340
I haven't talked to her in 10 years.
這不是約會，我們失聯10年

128
00:07:39,620 --> 00:07:42,820
You can't just call up and ask somebody for a favor.
總不能一通電話過去 就要人家幫忙

129
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:45,890
There are rules, you know? You gotta put in some time.
要講人情世故，花點時間客套

130
00:07:46,130 --> 00:07:47,320
Right,I'm sorry.
沒錯，對不起 

131
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:51,030
-It's not like she's an ex-girlfriend. -We only went out once.
你又不是去見舊情人 我們只約過一次會

132
00:07:51,330 --> 00:07:52,890
You dated her?!
你跟她交往過？

134
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,660
Not once.
一次也沒有

135
00:07:57,140 --> 00:08:01,370
Why don't I just go out with an ex, you know, and do Joey a favor?
乾脆我也去找個前男友 來幫喬伊的忙

136
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:04,880
You want to do Joey a favor? Maybe you go out with Joey.
想幫喬伊的忙就跟喬伊約會

137
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:16,690
That's great. My friend Joey's in the movie business.
真好，我朋友喬伊也在電影圈

138
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:19,730
You know who I ran into from school? Howie.
你猜我那天遇見誰？豪伊

139
00:08:20,330 --> 00:08:22,320
My friend's name is Joey.
我的朋友叫喬伊

140
00:08:22,930 --> 00:08:25,260
Apparently, Howie's editing now.
豪伊在當剪接師

141
00:08:25,530 --> 00:08:29,590
Yeah,he calls me up and asks me if he can edit my new movie.
他打來問能不能剪我的新片

142
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,200
Can you believe that?
你相信嗎？

143
00:08:31,410 --> 00:08:34,240
You know,I haven't spoken to him in 10 years...
我們10年沒聯絡 

144
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:37,100
and he asks me for a favor?
他居然來找我幫忙

145
00:08:39,610 --> 00:08:41,910
Yeah,I've always hated that Howie.
我一向很討厭那傢伙

146
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:45,080
No "How you doing?"
連聲好都沒問 

147
00:08:45,350 --> 00:08:48,410
Man,I mean,not even a cup of coffee first.
連先喝杯咖啡都沒有

148
00:08:48,620 --> 00:08:50,450
-The nerve. -Yeah.
好大膽 就是啊

149
00:08:50,690 --> 00:08:52,020
Refill?
續杯嗎？

150
00:08:53,790 --> 00:08:57,130
This is last-minute, so I want to apologize for the mess.
事出突然，抱歉房裡一團亂

151
00:08:57,370 --> 00:08:58,920
Oh,who cares?

152
00:09:01,970 --> 00:09:05,770
Oh,my God! It sure didn't look this way when I lived here.
天哪 我住的時候絕對不是長這樣 

154
00:09:05,970 --> 00:09:07,370
I know!
我知道

155
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:13,610
But there's only room for one, so one of you will have to stay at Joey's.
問題是這裡只能睡一個人 另一個人得去住喬伊家

156
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:18,880
Since the fire was kind of my fault, you should get to stay here.
既然失火是我引起的 你就睡這裡吧

157
00:09:19,150 --> 00:09:23,110
Hey,hey, now. This was no one's fault. It was an accident.
誰也沒有錯，那是個意外

158
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:25,830
It was my fault. You should get the nice room.
不，是我害的，你應該睡這裡 

159
00:09:26,090 --> 00:09:27,650
Okay!
好吧

160
00:09:28,830 --> 00:09:30,890
You're the first guest at "Hotel Monica."
瑞秋，你是本飯店的首位貴客

161
00:09:31,130 --> 00:09:32,160
Hotel Monica!

162
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:34,420
Just tell me how you like your eggs.
你得告訴我早餐想吃什麼蛋 

163
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:37,070
I thought I'd bring them to you in bed.
我打算端到床上給你

164
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:39,640
-You've been through so much. -I have.
-你吃了這麼多苦 -就是啊

165
00:09:41,340 --> 00:09:44,310
This right here is where I keep the pizza.
這是我放披薩的地方

166
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:47,810
And that's where the napkin is.
紙巾在那裡

167
00:09:48,750 --> 00:09:52,010
-What's that smell? -I know! I don't...
什麼味道？ 就是啊

168
00:09:55,420 --> 00:09:59,920
Oh, please, it was such a big class. You never even noticed me.
拜託，那麼大一個班 你根本沒有注意到我

169
00:10:00,130 --> 00:10:04,430
What? Of course I did. You sat next to "Sleepy Sleeperson."
當然有，你坐愛困睡人森旁邊 

170
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:05,650
Who?
誰？

171
00:10:05,930 --> 00:10:09,840
Oh. I had trouble remembering names, so I came up with nicknames.
我記不住全班的名字 就取綽號代替

172
00:10:10,100 --> 00:10:14,100
The guy on the other side of you was "Smelly Von Brown Shirt."
像你的另一邊是發臭馮棕上衣

173
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:16,440
Oh,yeah.
沒錯

174
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:22,220
-So did you have a nickname for me? -No. No.
你有幫我取綽號嗎？ 沒有

175
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:24,470
Yes,you did. What was it?
你有，是什麼？

176
00:10:27,490 --> 00:10:28,850
"Cutie McPretty."
可愛麥美眉

177
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:32,020
Oh,that's so sweet!
真好

178
00:10:33,330 --> 00:10:36,420
Listen, I gotta tell you, I'm having a great time.
說真的，今晚真的很開心

179
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:40,530
You said it might be weird, the whole student/teacher thing?
你之前說師生約會很奇怪

180
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:43,530
And to be frank, I thought it would be too.
其實我也有同感 

181
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:46,070
But it's not. I mean,it's not at all.
結果不會，一點也不會

182
00:10:50,210 --> 00:10:52,080
-Dr. Geller! -Burt!
蓋勒博士 伯特

183
00:10:55,580 --> 00:10:58,350
-Did you sleep well last night? -I did.
你昨晚睡得好嗎？ 很好

184
00:10:58,550 --> 00:11:02,040
Monica was so sweet. She left a little mint on my pillow.
摩妮卡還在我的枕頭上 放了一小片薄荷

185
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:04,520
Know what Joey left on my pillow?
你猜喬伊在我枕頭上放什麼？

186
00:11:04,730 --> 00:11:05,890
Gum.
口香糖

187
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:11,890
-We determined the cause of the fire. -I know. It was my candle,my candle!
-找到起火原因了 -我知道，是我的蠟燭害的

189
00:11:12,930 --> 00:11:16,890
No,there was an appliance left on. It looks like a curling iron.
不是，浴室有個電器沒拔掉 好像是卷髮器

190
00:11:17,170 --> 00:11:19,570
-I don't use a curling iron. -Someone does.
-我沒在用卷髮器 -總有人在用

191
00:11:20,010 --> 00:11:23,700
Don't look at me, my hair's straight. Straight,straight,straight.
別看我，我的頭髮是直的 直的直的直的

192
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:27,510
-It could've been a hair straightener. -Oh.
也可能是直髮夾

193
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:31,880
This is where I keep the pizza.
披薩都放這裡

194
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:35,220
And.. Hey,where'd the napkin go?
紙巾呢？

195
00:11:37,460 --> 00:11:39,020
What is that?
什麼味道？

196
00:11:39,730 --> 00:11:41,700
Is that old shrimp?
是臭掉的蝦子嗎？

197
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:46,070
I think it is!
應該是喔

198
00:11:51,610 --> 00:11:54,600
I wouldn't want my best guest to strain her eyes.
好了，可不能讓貴客眼睛疲勞

199
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,640
Thanks,Monica.
謝謝摩妮卡

200
00:11:57,710 --> 00:12:00,150
-Does that smell bother you? -From Joey's?
-你怕那個味道嗎？ -喬伊家的味道？

201
00:12:00,310 --> 00:12:02,250
I can hardly smell it over here.
這裡又聞不到

202
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:07,450
Well, you let me know if you can. I can bake a pie to cover it.
聞得到就說 我可以烤個派把它蓋過去

203
00:12:08,660 --> 00:12:11,420
-I can smell it a little, bake a pie. -Okay.
-有點聞得到，烤個派吧 -好

204
00:12:15,630 --> 00:12:16,820
Hello?
喂？

205
00:12:17,060 --> 00:12:19,900
One minute,please. It's the fire inspector.
在，請稍候 火場調查員找你

207
00:12:20,670 --> 00:12:23,660
Hello? Yeah, this is Phoebe.
喂？我是菲比

208
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:25,260
Really?
是嗎？

209
00:12:25,470 --> 00:12:29,340
Yeah, so it turns out that it wasn't the hair straightener...
是的，所以直髮夾...

210
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:31,310
that started the fire.
不是起火點

211
00:12:31,610 --> 00:12:33,910
No,no. It was the candles.
不，是蠟燭 

212
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:37,480
Yeah. It's very not good leaving candles unattended.
把蠟燭點著不管實在不太好

213
00:12:37,750 --> 00:12:42,350
In fact,one of the first things they teach you in fire school is...
消防學校最先教的事情之一…

214
00:12:46,690 --> 00:12:48,860
okay, well I have to go now.
好，我該掛了

215
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,830
We had such a great time. She's incredible.
我們玩得好開心，她好棒

216
00:12:57,100 --> 00:13:00,870
I thought the age difference might be a problem, but it wasn't.
我以為年齡會造成問題 結果一點也不會

217
00:13:01,110 --> 00:13:03,440
Elizabeth is very mature for her age.
伊麗莎白非常成熟

218
00:13:08,150 --> 00:13:11,120
A concept lost on some people.
有些人就是不懂

219
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:12,940
It's okay to date a student?
所以師生可以約會

220
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:17,060
Well,not really. Technically, it's not against the rules.
也不是，技術上沒觸犯校規 

221
00:13:17,290 --> 00:13:21,280
But it's frowned upon, especially by the professor we saw last night:
但是會受爭議 尤其是我們昨晚遇見的教授

223
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:23,500
"Judgy Von Holier-than-thou."
愛批評馮比你高尚

224
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:31,490
You don't want to get a reputation as "Professor McNails-his-students."
羅斯，小心一點 別被叫成麥泡學生教授

225
00:13:34,380 --> 00:13:37,830
-Yeah. What should I do? -Well,it seems pretty clear.
-我該怎麼辦？ -很簡單

227
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:41,310
What's more important? What people think or how you feel?
什麼比較重要？ 別人的看法還是你的感覺？

228
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:45,020
-You gotta follow your heart. -Joey,that's so sweet.
你得忠於你的心 喬伊，你說得真好

230
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,720
-Hi. -Hey! So how'd it go with Dana?
你跟黛娜談得怎樣？ 

231
00:13:52,930 --> 00:13:56,590
Any reason I should leave a block of time open? Say,Thursday?
我星期四該不該空出時間來？

232
00:13:57,030 --> 00:13:59,190
-I couldn't do it. -You couldn't do it?
-我說不出口 -你說不出口？

233
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:01,870
I need more time. We're going to dinner.
別急，我需要更多時間 我們晚上要吃飯

234
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:03,930
You're going out with her again?
什麼？你還要跟她出去

235
00:14:05,740 --> 00:14:08,830
-Going out with who? -Dana Keystone, from college.
跟誰出去？ 大學的黛娜基史東

236
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:11,740
Oh,yeah. Wasn't she...?
她不是…

237
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:14,950
No,that was Dana Kaplan.
那是黛娜卡普林

238
00:14:15,180 --> 00:14:16,510
Oh.

239
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:20,780
-Joey, you didn't even know her! -Yeah,whatever.
喬伊，你根本不認識她 隨便啦

240
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:26,750
Great story again.
故事真的好棒

241
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:30,900
The yarns that you weave!
好錯綜複雜

242
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:34,900
You know, actually, I should get going.
我該走了

243
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:39,100
Oh,no,no,stay! Because you should stay.
留下來，你應該留下來

244
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:45,080
Oh,I am really flattered.
我真的很受寵若驚 

245
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:49,720
But I just... I don't feel that way about you.
但是我對你沒感覺

246
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,380
Oh,no,no. That's not..
不，我不是…不是

247
00:14:52,590 --> 00:14:56,220
I'm sorry, Chandler. You know, you're such a sweet guy...
錢德，對不起 你人很好...

248
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:58,580
and I don't want to hurt you.
我也不想傷害你

249
00:14:58,790 --> 00:15:01,920
I wish I could do something to make you feel better.
真想設法讓你好過一點 

250
00:15:02,130 --> 00:15:04,260
No.. Really?
不…真的嗎？

251
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,060
Of course.
當然

252
00:15:07,070 --> 00:15:09,260
Well,it just hurts so bad, I...
我真是太傷心了，我…

253
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:12,270
Oh,I'm sorry.
對不起

254
00:15:12,470 --> 00:15:16,910
-Maybe there is one thing you can do. -What? Anything. Anything.
-或許你可以做一件事 -什麼事？你儘管說

255
00:15:17,580 --> 00:15:20,950
Well, I mean, this is just off the top of my head now.
我是剛剛才想到的

256
00:15:22,350 --> 00:15:24,910
But I have this friend.. This actor friend.
我有個演員朋友 

257
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:28,250
He would kill me if he knew that I was doing this.
他要是知道一定會殺了我

258
00:15:28,990 --> 00:15:30,080
But...
但...

259
00:15:31,590 --> 00:15:36,690
would it be possible for him to audition for your movie on Thursday?
你可不可能讓他去試鏡 就星期四吧？

260
00:15:37,830 --> 00:15:39,300
Absolutely.
沒問題

261
00:15:39,530 --> 00:15:40,760
But...
但是...

262
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:45,940
you'd really feel better if your friend could audition for my movie?
我讓你的朋友來試鏡 真的能讓你好過一點？

263
00:15:46,170 --> 00:15:48,300
The heart wants what it wants. Bye.
這是我的心願，再見

264
00:15:55,550 --> 00:15:58,020
Hey! How's it going?
怎麼樣啊？ 

265
00:15:58,220 --> 00:16:01,310
Well,not much has changed in the last five minutes.
這5分鐘都沒什麼變化

266
00:16:01,790 --> 00:16:03,650
Yes,it has. I made cookies!
其實有，我烤了餅乾

267
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:06,830
I'm still full from your homemade potato chips.
不了，我還在消化你做的薯片

268
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:12,150
But you should eat them now, because they're hot from the oven.
但是餅乾應該剛烤好就趁熱吃

269
00:16:12,530 --> 00:16:13,520
Okay.
好 

270
00:16:13,730 --> 00:16:18,230
But not in here! Can't eat them in bed,remember? No crumbies!
但不是在這裡 床上不能吃餅乾，不能掉屑屑

272
00:16:18,470 --> 00:16:21,670
Oh. Okay,I'll be out in a second.
好，我馬上出去 

273
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:22,900
Okay.
好

274
00:16:31,590 --> 00:16:34,210
-What are you doing? -This doesn't lock,does it?
-你在幹什麼？ -門不能鎖對吧？

275
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:44,820
-Oh! Joey,I'm sorry. -It's all right,don't worry about it.
-喬伊，對不起  -沒關係，別在意

277
00:16:45,070 --> 00:16:47,500
But look! That's gonna leave a stain.
但是你看，會有印子

278
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:51,260
Rach, hey, it's fine. You're at Joey's.
瑞秋，沒關係，這是喬伊家

279
00:16:52,270 --> 00:16:54,570
-Really? -Yeah, look.
真的嗎？ 當然，你看

280
00:16:58,950 --> 00:17:00,000
Yeah.

281
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:03,350
-I've never lived like this before. -I know.
-我沒有這樣吃過東西  -我知道

282
00:17:07,350 --> 00:17:10,190
Well,don't waste it. I mean, it's still food.
別浪費了，這是食物

283
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:19,190
What do you want to do now? Want to get a drink?
接著要幹嘛？要不要去喝酒？

284
00:17:19,430 --> 00:17:20,420
I can't.
我不行

285
00:17:20,630 --> 00:17:25,230
-Oh,you have some studying to do? -No,I have some turning 21 to do.
-你要唸書？ -不是，我要滿21歲

286
00:17:26,970 --> 00:17:29,940
You know, I remember when I was in college,we used to..
我以前念大學時，我們都…

287
00:17:33,310 --> 00:17:37,750
-What are you doing? -Nothing, I'm so comfortable with you.
你幹什麼？ 沒事，我只是覺得好舒服

288
00:17:41,460 --> 00:17:43,550
Do you not want to be seen with me?
你怕被別人看見？

289
00:17:43,790 --> 00:17:46,230
No,of course I do. Are they gone?
什麼？當然不是 他們走了嗎？

290
00:17:47,430 --> 00:17:50,560
No,they're still here. But I think I'm about to leave.
他們還在，不過我要走了 

291
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:53,390
What? No,no,wait,wait..
什麼？等一下

292
00:17:53,970 --> 00:17:57,400
You're right, this is stupid. Who cares what people think?
你說得對，這樣太蠢了 管別人怎麼想

293
00:17:57,670 --> 00:17:59,640
I mean, we like each other, right?
我們情投意合，對吧？ 

294
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,740
There's nothing wrong with that.
這樣並沒有錯

295
00:18:02,780 --> 00:18:03,800
Come on.
走吧

296
00:18:08,020 --> 00:18:10,920
Burt. Lydia. Mel.
伯特，莉蒂亞，梅爾

297
00:18:12,590 --> 00:18:14,520
-This is Elizabeth. -Hi.
這位是伊麗莎白

298
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:17,190
Aren't you in my popular culture class?
你不是有修我的大眾文化？

299
00:18:17,460 --> 00:18:19,890
That's right, Lydia. Elizabeth is a student.
沒錯，伊麗莎白是學生 

300
00:18:20,090 --> 00:18:21,820
And we're dating.
我們在交往

301
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:25,160
And you may frown upon that but...
你們可以皺眉搖頭 

302
00:18:25,370 --> 00:18:27,800
we're not gonna hide it anymore.
但我們不會再躲了

303
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,540
You are so fired.
你的飯碗砸定了

304
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:34,940
-What? -They'll fire you.
-什麼？-你會被解聘 

305
00:18:35,180 --> 00:18:37,700
You can't date her. It's against the rules.
跟學生交往是違規的

306
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:40,540
Really? It's not just frowned upon?
真的？不只是受爭議？

307
00:18:45,550 --> 00:18:48,020
I love it at Joey's!
我最喜歡喬伊家了

308
00:18:51,830 --> 00:18:53,190
-Nice! -Thanks.
漂亮 謝謝

309
00:18:53,390 --> 00:18:54,720
So you busy Thursday?
你星期四有事嗎？

310
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:59,890
Oh,very funny. Remember? My audition was supposed to be Thursday.
真好笑，不曉得你記不記得 我的試鏡就是星期四

311
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:06,510
You got me the audition? Let's hug it up!
你幫我爭取到了？來抱抱

312
00:19:06,710 --> 00:19:10,970
Okay,okay! What are you gonna do to me if you get the part?
要是你入選還得了

314
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:14,310
-Hey. -Hi.

315
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:17,040
Yeah,okay,I need to talk to you.
我有事要找你

316
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:20,580
I know they said the hair straightener started the fire.
我知道他們說直髮夾是起火點 

317
00:19:20,850 --> 00:19:22,850
But I think I'm partly at fault.
但我也有責任

318
00:19:23,060 --> 00:19:25,580
You see,I didn't tell you, but...
我沒有告訴你 

319
00:19:25,860 --> 00:19:28,520
I had recently refilled the tissues.
我放了新的衛生紙

320
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:31,420
And so,let's face it, that's just kindling.
那個太容易著火了

321
00:19:31,730 --> 00:19:34,700
So I think it's fair that I stay at Joey's.
所以我應該來住喬伊家

322
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:37,670
No, no, no, this was my fault.
不，菲比，都是我不好 

323
00:19:37,910 --> 00:19:40,340
-Besides,I'm fine here. -Okay.
-而且我在這裡好得很 -好吧…

324
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:43,510
-Chandler,Monica's looking for you. -Really?
-錢德，摩妮卡在找你 -是喔？

325
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:48,080
-She said something about crumbies. -No,no,no! I was so careful.
好像跟餅乾屑有關 不會吧，我那麼小心

327
00:19:49,850 --> 00:19:53,080
You have to switch with me. Monica is driving me crazy.
你一定要跟我換 摩妮卡快把我逼瘋了

328
00:19:53,290 --> 00:19:57,250
That's right. All the ladies want to stay at Joey's.
是的，小姐們都想住喬伊家

329
00:19:58,930 --> 00:20:00,860
No,I don't want to switch.
不要，我不想換 

330
00:20:01,130 --> 00:20:03,760
Please! I can throw wet paper towels here!
拜託啦，我在這裡可以扔紙巾

331
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:07,460
No,but at Monica's, you can eat cookies over the sink.
在對面你可以對著水槽吃餅乾

332
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,700
I know. I'm sorry.
我知道，對不起 

333
00:20:12,370 --> 00:20:13,930
All right,fine.
算了

334
00:20:14,470 --> 00:20:19,140
This looks like so much fun. God,what a mess.
這個好像很好玩，濕答答的

335
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:28,210
Wow, it actually is in the handbook.
校規裡真的有

336
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:32,720
I can't date you or have a hot plate in my office.
我不能和你約會 或是在研究室放電磁爐

337
00:20:34,630 --> 00:20:38,120
I can't believe we have to stop seeing each other.
我們居然不能再見面了

338
00:20:39,330 --> 00:20:42,960
For what it's worth, I did appreciate you standing up for me.
不過謝謝你為我挺身而出 

339
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:46,070
That felt really nice.
我好感動

340
00:20:46,770 --> 00:20:48,830
Kind of made me like you even more.
我更喜歡你了

341
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:53,270
I know,I know. I really like you too. But we can't date.
我知道，我也很喜歡你 但是我們不能交往

342
00:20:53,510 --> 00:20:55,910
It's against the rules. It's forbidden.
校規明文禁止師生戀

343
00:20:56,950 --> 00:20:59,320
-Wow. -What?
怎麼了？

344
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:03,180
Just hearing you describe it as "forbidden"...
光聽你說校規禁止 

346
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:05,020
it's really hot.
就覺得好性感

347
00:21:06,990 --> 00:21:08,360
Really?
真的？ 

348
00:21:09,300 --> 00:21:10,700
Yeah.
對

349
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:16,130
Well,I don't care how hot it is, it's wrong.
不管有多性感，這都是錯的

350
00:21:17,870 --> 00:21:21,500
-Stop it. -No,no. It's wrong.
-別再說了 -不，這是錯的

352
00:21:21,940 --> 00:21:23,430
It's naughty.
這樣很壞

353
00:21:24,710 --> 00:21:25,870
It's...
這是...

354
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:28,180
taboo.
禁忌

355
00:21:28,980 --> 00:21:30,540
Shut the book.
把書合起來

356
00:21:32,220 --> 00:21:35,480
Hey. Let's also get a hot plate.
再去弄個電磁爐吧

357
00:21:40,190 --> 00:21:41,180
Hey.

358
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:42,620
Hey.

359
00:21:42,830 --> 00:21:45,560
-So? -So...?
怎樣啊？ 怎樣？

360
00:21:45,630 --> 00:21:47,860
It's Thursday! How was the audition?
今天是星期四，試鏡結果如何

361
00:21:48,070 --> 00:21:52,300
It's.. Monday, one day. Tuesday, two day. Wednesday,what day..
